    "summary": "When you select this unit to fight in the **[Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase)** and the unit isn't **[battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**, you may roll one D6 as a **[psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities)** for it. If you do, the unit becomes battle-shocked on a 1, and for the rest of that phase its melee attacks gain **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** and **[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)**.",
